  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: GSSAPI client state persisting across authentication\n     attempts\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106555.patch: reset the GSSAPI client state\n       at the start of each userauth request and of each pre-authentication\n       GSSAPI context setup in the monitor.\n     - CVE-2026-106555\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: GSSAPI delegated credentials stored after failed\n     authentication\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106553.patch: only store delegated GSSAPI\n       credentials when the GSSAPI client was authorized.\n     - CVE-2026-106553\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: command injection via command-line user name\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106583.patch: disallow '$' and '\\' in a\n       user name supplied on the ssh command line.\n     - CVE-2026-106583",
